<title>BRAZIL: Eletrobras Jan-Sept net 2.1 bln reais.</title>
<headline>Eletrobras Jan-Sept net 2.1 bln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's state power utility holding Eletrobras issued the following statement on its January-to-September results.</p>
<p>			    Jan-Sept 1996	  Jan-Sept 1995</p>
<p>    shr profit		 39.85 reais		N/A</p>
<p>    net profit		  2.1 bln		   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE: All data above in Brazil's real. Share profit figures provided in lots of 1,000 stocks.</p>
<p>It said its profit increased 1,201 percent when compared with the same period last year.</p>
<p>-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom, 55-11-2485412</p>
